---@meta
-- Generated by rs3-api-types from https://developer.runescape.com/rs/game/config/headbartype.html;
-- regenerate it with ./gradlew generate rather than editing it.

---A `HeadbarType` config contains data about the various headbar overlays that can be drawn above an entity.
---
---These config types can be found within the `config.Headbar` table:
---
---Info: A `HeadbarType` is a Proxy usertype, which means it is safe to copy and store in your scripts. It cannot,
---however, be used with any persistent storage.
---
---Information available within an `HeadbarType` includes:
---@class HeadbarType
---@field id integer (Read-only) The ID of this config type.
---@field configName string (Read-only) The name of this config, i.e. `"ADRENALINE_DEFAULT"`.
---@field typeName string (Read-only) The type of this config. Will always be `"Headbar"`.
---@field displayOrder integer (Read-only) The draw order of the headbar. Headbars are drawn from bottom-upwards. A higher value draws later.
